OL,3,GNEWSA'Emotional' world title for
OL,4,AFormula E team
OL,5,
OL,6,FTeam principal Ian James said the fans
OL,7,Fhad been "the biggest winners out of
OL,8,Fthis one because to see racing of the
OL,9,Fquality, that is something else".
